  "system": {
    "description": "<p>Flowers sprout from the ground at your feet, filling the air with toxic spores.</p><p>Each other creature within a <strong>5-space-radius</strong> of you must make an opposed <strong>Resilience</strong> check or take <strong>1 Damage</strong> at the start of their turn. This <strong>Damage</strong> ignores <strong>Armor</strong>.</p><p>Additionally, affected creatures become <strong>Contaminated</strong> until the start of your next turn.</p><p>Each extra success increases the <strong>Damage</strong> inflicted by <strong>+1</strong>.</p><p>Alternatively, you may extend the duration by <strong>+1 rounds</strong> per extra success.</p><p>This spell only affects living, physical creatures that need to breathe.</p><p><strong>Effect:</strong> @UUID[Compendium.titan-vttrpg-compendium.effects.ActiveEffect.F1slX3D7FLPvLPLn]{Poisonous Bloom}</p>",
